        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="project-label">DEMO CONCEPT 02</div>
        <h3>Coaching Website</h3>
        <p>
          A clean concept for an educational
          institute and its courses.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="project-label">DEMO CONCEPT 03</div>
        <h3>Portfolio Website</h3>
        <p>
          A personal portfolio concept to
          showcase skills and projects.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PRICING -->

<section id="pricing">
  <div class="container">

    <h2 class="section-title">Starter Packages</h2>

    <p class="subtitle">
      Illustrative starting prices for simple projects
    </p>

    <div class="grid">

      <div class="card">
